{"case_id": "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", "domain": "health", "question": "2022年至现在，命主的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "D", "raw_answer": "首先，命主虚岁36岁（2022年）进入田宅宫大限（33-42岁）。本命疾厄宫廉贞庙旺无煞，显示先天体质尚可，但福德宫巨门化忌，主暗疾、思虑过度，易有肠胃、管道类隐患。大限田宅宫紫微天相却被火星、铃星夹辅，火铃为突发、炎症之星，在此大限易有慢性炎症或代谢问题急性发作。\n\n结合流年四化：2023年癸卯，贪狼化忌冲射疾厄宫，贪狼属木主肝胆，化忌则肝功能受损、代谢紊乱；2024年甲辰，太阳化忌在命宫，太阳陷主阳气不足，引申为下肢循环不佳、脚患或精神萎靡；2025年乙巳，太阴化忌亦在命宫，太阴主水湿、皮肉，化忌易水肿、肥胖。加之福德宫巨门化忌对应肠胃暗病，综合呈现肝、肠胃、脚患及体形肥胖等多系统问题，符合选项D的复合特征，而非单一手术或糖尿病等。\n\n最终答案：D", "correct": true, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1b", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-pro", "hongkong_female_19870705_P002-Q6", 0, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\benchmark\\outputs\\phase6_6b1d_r3\\slice_2025_b1b_R0_P4_G0\\details_2025_b1b_R0_P4_G0.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 41479, "response_id": "6070d6ae-7992-4b81-bccb-bef3ad51bda5", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 731, "completion_tokens": 2377, "total_tokens": 3108, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 512}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 2124}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 219}}
